<title>NETHERLANDS: Aegon 1996 net rises 18.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Aegon 1996 net rises 18.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>THE HAGUE 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     5.93  vs   5.05</p>
<p>    Net profit (billion)		 1.568 vs   1.323</p>
<p>    Pre tax profits (billions)	 2.013 vs   1.720</p>
<p>    Tax				    445     vs 397</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  2.79  vs   2.37</p>
<p>    Revenues (billions)		 24.487 vs  20.979</p>
<p>Note - Analysts had expected Aegon NV to report a net profit of 1.535 to 1.567 billion guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
